      "message": "My feeling is if as a programmer you can\u0027t understand why one needs to escape user supplied input we\u0027ve got bigger problems than the lack of a comment explaining the necessity for escaping. Superfluous comments for things which are supposed to be obvious are considered bad form. But if one is still befuddled there is always the commit message :-)\n\nHowever I did try to accommodate this request. The problem I ran into was I couldn\u0027t find any wording that would fit in a single line comment that adhered to PEP-8 indentation and line length rules. A multi-line comment seemed too invasive and then shouldn\u0027t there be a comment for each location that performs escaping? Just seemed overkill. If you feel strongly we can revisit.",
